### Lab 2.2 - Task Manager with cookies
### Start it first:  ./gradlew runLab3   (or run com.vizja.lab3.App)

### First visit: the response carries three Set-Cookie headers (visits, lastVisit, prevVisit)
GET http://localhost:8080/

### Return visit: send the cookies back, the server answers with visits=2 and prevVisit=<old lastVisit>
GET http://localhost:8080/
Cookie: visits=1; lastVisit=1700000000000

### Tampered cookie values are sanitised (visits=abc becomes 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/
Cookie: visits=abc; lastVisit=-5

### CRUD still works exactly as in Lab 2.1
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks

###
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Try cookies",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 5,
  "status": "DONE"
}

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 5
}

### Unknown paths return 404 in the Lab 2.2 framework
GET http://localhost:8080/nope
